# Paths the frontend's client calls that the server does not mount.
#
# This file is a debt ledger, not a design. Every line is a screen in the
# shipped interface that cannot work, and the list exists so the gate can be
# green while the debt stays visible and countable instead of being discovered
# one screen at a time.
#
# The subsystems behind most of these are built and their tests pass. What is
# missing is the route that reaches them, which is Q8 and Q9 in
# docs/proposals/OPEN-QUESTIONS.md.
#
# The rule for this file: a line comes out when the route is mounted. A line
# goes in only with a recorded reason that the server genuinely need not serve
# it. Nothing here has such a reason yet, which is why every line below is
# grouped by the phase that owns it rather than excused.
#
# Cutover is blocked while this file is non-empty.

# --- Phase 3 (auth): sign-in itself, the second factor, credential admin.
# Signing in is now mounted where the client asks. What remains here is the
# rest of the account surface, including changing a password: the client calls
# it and the Go build has no handler for it at all.
/api/auth/app-passwords/{}/wipe
/api/auth/password
/api/auth/login/totp
/api/auth/oidc/link
/api/auth/oidc/link/start
/api/auth/smb
/api/auth/smb/password
/api/auth/totp/disable
/api/auth/totp/enroll
/api/auth/totp/recovery-codes
/api/auth/totp/setup

# --- Phase 5 (HTTP surface): the admin screens, jobs, shares, archive.
/api/admin/audit
/api/admin/grants
/api/admin/grants/{}
/api/admin/groups
/api/admin/groups/{}
/api/admin/groups/{}/members
/api/admin/groups/{}/members/{}
/api/admin/server-settings/{}
/api/admin/server-settings/archive
/api/admin/server-settings/db
/api/admin/server-settings/homes
/api/admin/server-settings/oidc
/api/admin/server-settings/paths
/api/admin/server-settings/restart
/api/admin/server-settings/search
/api/admin/server-settings/smb
/api/admin/server-settings/symlink-policy
/api/admin/server-settings/watch
/api/admin/storage
/api/admin/upload-settings
/api/admin/users
/api/admin/users/{}
/api/admin/users/{}/oidc
/api/fs/archive
/api/jobs
/api/shares
/api/shares/{}

# --- Phase 8 (search): the index build, its estimate and its settings.
/api/admin/index/build
/api/admin/index/estimate
/api/admin/index/settings

